OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FWednesday will be a little fresher and
OL,7,Fbreezy with sunshine and scattered
OL,8,Fshowers. Becoming drier and less
OL,9,Fbreezy to end the week with more
OL,10,Fprolonged spells of sunshine, though
OL,11,Fcooler.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
